# Binary assets must never be touched by git's end-of-line conversion.
#
# The bundled font is the case that matters: with core.autocrlf=true (the
# default on Windows) a checkout rewrites the bytes of Inter-Variable.ttf, and
# the browser then fails to decode it - the app silently falls back to
# system-ui and the whole design system is lost. The same conversion would
# eventually corrupt the icons and the release artifacts.
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.heic binary
*.zip binary
*.7z binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.pyd binary
*.so binary
